{"id":"HAD-0522","recordType":"hadith","language":"de","narratorLine":"ʿĀʾishah رضي الله عنها berichtete:","speakerLabel":"Der Prophet ﷺ sagte:","textMarkdown":"Wem Sanftmut vorenthalten wird, dem wird das Gute **vorenthalten**.","source":"Ṣaḥīḥ Muslim","grade":"Ṣaḥīḥ","verificationNote":"Ḥadīṯ-Unterblock im 100er-Schritt 451–550."}